### =========================
### SOFTWARE ENGINEER API
### Base URL: http://localhost:8080/api/v1/software-engineer
### =========================


### =========================
### CREATE
### =========================

### Create - valid
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/software-engineer
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Pranshu",
  "techStack": "Java"
}

### Create - validation error (blank name)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/software-engineer
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "",
  "techStack": "Java"
}

### Create - validation error (missing techStack)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/software-engineer
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Pranshu"
}


### =========================
### READ
### =========================

### Get all
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/software-engineer

### Get by id - exists
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/software-engineer/5

### Get by id - not exists
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/software-engineer/999


### =========================
### UPDATE
### =========================

### Update - exists
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/v1/software-engineer/5
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Pranshu Patel",
  "techStack": "Java, Spring Boot, Docker"
}

### Update - not exists
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/v1/software-engineer/999
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Test",
  "techStack": "Java & Spring Boot"
}


### =========================
### DELETE
### =========================

### Delete - exists
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/v1/software-engineer/6

### Delete - not exists
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/v1/software-engineer/999
